	(descr "GMB CP105050 Li-MnO2 pouch cell, per GMB datasheet: body 50.0 +/-0.5 x 50.0 +/-0.5 x 1.0 +/-0.1 mm (max 1.1 x 50.5 x 51); 2 tabs on one edge, each 3.0 +/-0.1 wide x 10.0 +/-1.0 long, 37.0 +/-1.0 mm centre to centre. Origin = body centre, tabs point +Y. Pads 5 x 8 mm start 2 mm past the nominal body edge so a 9-11 mm tab, offset up to 1 mm, still lands on copper. Pad 1 (+) is on the right with the printed label face UP and tabs pointing down (datasheet: tabs up, + on left). Hand-solder only, never reflow; one tab is aluminium.")
